#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:5
msgid "Single line diagram"
msgstr "单线图"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:7
msgid ""
"The single line diagrams represent electric, fluid, etc. systems using a "
"simplified notation."
msgstr "单线图使用简化的表示方法来表示电气、流体等系统。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:9
msgid "`Single line conductors`_ are used to draw single line diagrams."
msgstr "`单线导体 <Single line conductors_>`_ 用于绘制单线图。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:13
msgid ""
"At electric schemas, the power system is represented with a simplified "
"notation and the control system is not represented. The `conductors`_ only "
"represent power cables."
msgstr "在电气原理图中，动力系统以简化的表示方法绘制，控制系统则不表示。`导体 <conductors_>`_ 仅表示动力电缆。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:15
msgid ""
"At fluid power schemas, the pressure and return line are represented by the "
"same `conductor`_."
msgstr "在流体动力原理图中，压力管路和回流管路用同一个 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 表示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/single_line_diagram.rst:21
msgid "Figure: Single line diagram"
msgstr "图：单线图"
